# This file's EXISTENCE stops vsce falling back to .gitignore (which excludes vendor/).
# The explicit negation keeps the vendored opencode shipping even if a future
# exclusion pattern would otherwise swallow it — that's the trap β.2 exists to kill.
!vendor/**
src/**
test/**
scripts/**
dev/**
node_modules/**
esbuild.config.mjs
tsconfig.json
**/*.map
!bin/**
!julia/**
!demo/**
# #161: the Pasqal connector MUST ship despite scripts/** above — activation
# stages it to <opsDir>/scripts/pasqal-connector (the Connections panel's
# default $AMICO_PASQAL_VALIDATOR resolution). Only the two runtime files:
# the tests/ subdir stays dev-only.
!scripts/pasqal-connector/pasqal_validate.py
!scripts/pasqal-connector/requirements.txt
